{"seq":3,"slug":"the-examined-life","title":"The Examined Life","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/ideas-and-methods/the-examined-life","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-unexamined-life","title":"未经省察的人生不值得过","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/ideas-and-methods/the-examined-life/the-unexamined-life","wordCount":1452,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"care-for-the-soul","title":"照料灵魂","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/ideas-and-methods/the-examined-life/care-for-the-soul","wordCount":1559,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"本章呈现苏格拉底关于如何生活的根本教诲。\"未经省察的人生是不值得过的\"——这句以生命作担保的箴言，宣告了理性省察对于人生的根本意义；\"照料灵魂\"——使灵魂趋于善与德性，是人生最重要的事业。本章揭示这种重内在德性、轻身外之物的人生智慧，及其对当代的深刻启示。\n"}